# Play test of Gullwing Bay (CIPlay gullwing_bay, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the jetty into the bay and its
# crate, the wreck on the bottom and her chest, the headland cave and its chest, the boars, the treasure. Points as in
# its recipe.
island Gullwing Bay
offset 0.0084 -5.2062
expect animals Warthog 3
expect animals Puffer fish 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
wait 3
kill Warthog
kill Puffer fish
# Out along the jetty
walk 6 14 to 6 20 to 6 28 h=1.5 below=4
expect stand 6.75 22.75 h=1.5 below=4
open Crate on the jetty
# Down to the wreck
at -2 28 h=-7
open The fishing boat's chest
# Into the headland cave
walk -31 14 to -31 10 to -31 6 h=2.1 below=3
open Chest in the headland cave
dig
